{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05349","headline":"哭郎着作 · 郑愔","name":"哭郎着作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗礼康成学，文章贾谊才。\n巳年人得梦，庚日鸟爲灾。\n书草藏天阁，琴声入夜台。\n荒阶罗驳藓，虚座网浮埃。\n白马宾徒散，青乌陇隧开。\n空怜门下客，怀旧几迟回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}